# The 1.14d excel tables are the authoritative bytes extracted straight from the
# retail MPQs (tools/extract_excel.zig). Keep them EXACTLY as extracted — CRLF and
# all — so the committed blobs stay byte-identical to the game data and a re-extract
# produces no phantom EOL diff. `-text` disables all end-of-line normalization while
# still allowing textual diffs for review.
src/excel/*.txt -text
